[00:07.624]You are the shelter, the love that covers me
{"你是庇护所　是笼罩我的爱"}
[00:11.428]From my head down to my feet
{"从头顶到脚尖将我覆盖"}
[00:15.291]Brought the only light in my darkest day
{"在我至暗时刻带来唯一的光彩"}
[00:18.843]You are my run, run, runaway
{"你是我逃离的避风港所在"}
